  "description": "Designed for use with Aspire’s sleek and powerful BP60 pod kit, these replacement coils come in two variations to help you tailor your vape experience. Vapers can enjoy a smooth, satisfying MTL (mouth-to-lung) experience with the 1.0ohm Mesh coils and High-PG E-Liquids, or a rich DL (direct-lung) vape with the 0.3ohm Mesh coils or 0.6ohm dual coils and High-VG E-Liquids. Built with premium materials, the BP60 coils offer long-lasting reliability and incredible flavour. The Aspire BP Coils are compatible with the following kits: BP Stik Kit: 0.15 Ohm Mesh, 0.17 Ohm Mesh, 0.3 Ohm Mesh, 0.6 Ohm, 1.0 Ohm BP60 Kit : 0.6 Ohm, 1.0 Ohm Onixx Kit : 0.6 Ohm, 1.0 Ohm Veynom LX Kit: 0.15 Ohm Mesh, 0.17 Ohm Mesh, 0.3 Ohm Mesh, 0.6 Ohm, 1.0 Ohm Veynom EX Kit : 0.15 Ohm Mesh, 0.17 Ohm Mesh, 0.3 Ohm Mesh, 0.6 Ohm, 1.0 Ohm Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
